and to stop the search. Search strings were also applied on Google for
GL collection. Pre-selection criteria were applied for this, by reading
the titles, abstracts (for WL), and summaries (for GL), to identify
appropriate literature.
3.4.3. Snowballing search
In addition to the database searches, snowballing was applied to lo-
cate relevant studies. In a normal way, we conducted database searches

