24X. Zhao et al.
Table 20
Steps of DevSecOps model by Gartner (MacDonald and Head, 2016).
Steps Definitions
Plan The step to set project objectives, identify security requirements,
plan security measures, define metrics and policies, prepare
organizations/teams, select technologies/tools, and develop
